{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫歌唱節目《聲秀》出身的藝人甄敏芳（Jenny），因標致外貌獲封新一代女神，上月的社交網追蹤人數突破3萬，令她興奮萬分。</p><p>Jenny於澳門出生及成長，對一海之隔的香港當然不會陌生，不過一場來到，換了遊客Mode也可開心一餐。</p><p>她於社交平台上載</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T01:20:47.692147+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:01:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.244822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.244822+00:00","content_hash":"67337967d81ef4184b3fb92b79dca962663a10c18031c9cc23f08da0d4300b1a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}